                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f83ea446-48f0-4d0c-a6b6-4c2eaa093514",
                        "source_entry_id": "ef59d8f6-322a-3032-a7c9-e17766d13b63",
                        "source_sense_id": "a3b3d7db-acf8-3ef0-9c6b-2e5972f563c6",
                        "source_sense_description": "aangenaam in omgang",
                        "target_lang_word": "charming",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "charming",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "deaa6b98-db82-3555-8dc8-b7e143bd046f",
                                        "entry_id": "2f3b312e-7e47-366c-ab8d-ef7a052a1f68",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pleasant, charismatic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "467c07bf-f574-47dd-a628-d64b6eaa501a",
                                                "sense_id": "deaa6b98-db82-3555-8dc8-b7e143bd046f",
                                                "text": "\"What a charming amusement for young people this is, Mr. Darcy! There is nothing like dancing after all. I consider it as one of the first refinements of polished society.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3bd636b7-28ea-4c12-b103-13684698b0c5",
                                                "sense_id": "deaa6b98-db82-3555-8dc8-b7e143bd046f",
                                                "text": "In the abstract, Stuhlbarg’s twinkly-eyed sidekick suggests Joe Pesci in Lethal Weapon 2 by way of late-period Robin Williams with an alien twist, but Stuhlbarg makes a character that easily could have come across as precious into a surprisingly palatable, even charming man."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "208436d7-ee7d-3363-b962-3e95231a3e40",
                                        "entry_id": "2f3b312e-7e47-366c-ab8d-ef7a052a1f68",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Delightful in a playful way which avoids responsibility or seriousness, as if attracting through a magical charm."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "charming",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "093d29ba-59da-39d7-8606-381c36dff685",
                                        "entry_id": "5e2d19b0-9bd3-3955-b9c5-4b35fe1b4419",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle and gerund of charm"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund",
                                            "participle",
                                            "present"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "charming",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "370c0d7b-9091-3263-9474-2b92900acd83",
                                        "entry_id": "b1b20f3e-2e53-313d-b38c-4b2bb6012bad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The casting of a magical charm."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c95fe1e-cb91-4f1f-9073-b37fc721660a",
                                                "sense_id": "370c0d7b-9091-3263-9474-2b92900acd83",
                                                "text": "They denied me often flour, barm and milk, / Goose-grease and tar, when I ne'er hurt their charmings, / Their brewlocks, nor their batches, nor forespoke / Any of their breedings."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "charming",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b314c870-8461-33a4-b5ab-acebb5c70809",
                                        "entry_id": "967ee3ff-c74d-35be-a69d-9e275da2b688",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used in response to behaviour or language considered offensive or uncouth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British",
                                            "ironic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94758a54-a189-423c-a199-6241b30bc952",
                                                "sense_id": "b314c870-8461-33a4-b5ab-acebb5c70809",
                                                "text": "The other murderer is sadistically hacked to pieces, while the proceedings are being videoed – and the DVD is sent to Nick's home so that his daughter can see it. Oh, charming."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e15e8eac-f286-4326-9d6c-712aa8bf47f3",
                        "source_entry_id": "ef59d8f6-322a-3032-a7c9-e17766d13b63",
                        "source_sense_id": "a3b3d7db-acf8-3ef0-9c6b-2e5972f563c6",
                        "source_sense_description": "aangenaam in omgang",
                        "target_lang_word": "charmant",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "charmant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b81446d7-4e0b-3895-917c-04bb9e6071ff",
                                        "entry_id": "c379a55a-0942-3fe4-885a-195bc58b0035",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a du charme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "103d3b0e-630d-4f53-bb4c-1b4b408cb6e8",
                                                "sense_id": "b81446d7-4e0b-3895-917c-04bb9e6071ff",
                                                "text": "Chemin faisant, j’eus le plaisir de voir plusieurs Portugaises qui soulevaient leurs jalousies pour nous examiner. Il y en avait très peu de jolies; mais une navigation de trois mois, et la difficulté de les voir, les rendaient charmantes à mes yeux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87a60c1b-ad68-40ec-946d-eed996acce38",
                                                "sense_id": "b81446d7-4e0b-3895-917c-04bb9e6071ff",
                                                "text": "En bon Champenois, il célébra le vin de Champagne dans une ode en vers iambiques, dont le style vif et pétillant, présente la belle image de cette charmante liqueur."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bea5a050-3733-4f6a-ae18-77b0929dc754",
                                                "sense_id": "b81446d7-4e0b-3895-917c-04bb9e6071ff",
                                                "text": "C’est l’heure charmante où l’alouette s’élève dans le ciel, salue de ses trilles et de ses roulades le matin jeune, virginal et triomphant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32ce0255-c49b-4177-ace4-6f7c47af3a16",
                                                "sense_id": "b81446d7-4e0b-3895-917c-04bb9e6071ff",
                                                "text": "Mes tempes battent ; toute ma chair va à cette femme presque nue et charmante dans le matin et dans le transparent vêtement qui enferme la douce odeur d’elle…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f15db52-b394-4bdd-bc27-1b464c0817ab",
                                                "sense_id": "b81446d7-4e0b-3895-917c-04bb9e6071ff",
                                                "text": "Il y a quelques jours j’ai été invité chez une charmante amie brune bossant dans la publicité, et claironnant bruyamment ses engagements féministes dès qu’elle le peut en public…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
